      "code": "if (strcmp(oid, DATA_OID) == 0) {",
      "note": "The staged witness's first AuthenticatedSafe entry has contentType pkcs7-data, so gnutls_pkcs12_get_bag takes the _parse_safe_contents() path and enters the vulnerable SafeContents decoder instead of the encrypted-bag path.",
